<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NAB to cut home loan rate to 8.75 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NAB to cut home loan rate to 8.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank Ltd announced a half percentage point cut in its variable home loan rates to 8.75 percent after the Reserve Bank cut the official cash rate on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
